# SPA fallback for Pages platforms (EdgeOne Pages honors this file).
# Any path not matching a static file is rewritten to index.html (HTTP 200),
# so deep links like /store /comic /chat /settings /login boot the SPA directly.
# Existing static files (assets, spa.js, ...) take precedence over this rule.
# NOTE (verified 2026-11-08): Cloudflare Pages bypasses _redirects entirely once
# a Functions bundle is attached, so the CF-side SPA fallback lives in
# functions/[[catchall]].js instead. This file is kept pure ASCII and retained
# for platforms that do evaluate it (e.g. EdgeOne Pages).
